{
  "rationale": "The plant models robot sensing and actuation: perception of obstacles and execution of motion commands. The specification encodes a safe, coverage-oriented exploration policy: random_walk is preferred in clear states, move_forward is used for short progress, and obstacle events trigger conservative, directed turn recovery. Full_rotate is reserved for rare, persistent blockage. All transitions are deterministic, and obstacle avoidance is prioritized without sacrificing steady exploration.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for sensing and motion: G1 models perception, G2 models motion commands.",
    "Specification E1 binds perception outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforcing conservative recovery and rapid return to exploration, with random_walk as the default in clear states."
  ],
